cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these codes, please cite the preprint given under preferred-citation."
title: "wormhole-qnm-chebyshev-2d: scalar quasinormal modes of the exact spinning Morris–Thorne wormhole"
abstract: >-
  Maple and Julia codes for the quasinormal modes of a massless scalar field on the complete
  two-ended geometry of the exact spinning Morris–Thorne wormhole. The problem is compactified
  and discretised by two-dimensional Chebyshev collocation into a quadratic eigenvalue problem,
  whose matrices are assembled in Maple and whose spectra are solved, filtered and analysed in
  Julia, with direct integration of the radial equation as an independent check and the Kerr
  spacetime as a benchmark.
